      "type": "text",
      "content": "Details of Kshethram:\nMoolavar: Neelamegha Perumal\nThayaar: Pundareegavalli Nachiyar\nVimanam: Mangala Vimanam\nPushkarani: Mangala Theertham\n\nTravel: This kshethram is located in Devaprayag en route to Badrinath.\n\nAzhwar Pasuram:\nPeriya Azhwar: 11 Pasurams",
