    {
      "order": 10,
      "depth": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "Sthala Puranam:\nAccording to legend, Lord Rama performed tapas here at this kshethram to nullify the brahmahatyadosham for killing Ravana. Lord Rama is also said to have bathed in the Ganga River and performed tarpanam for His forefathers here at this kshethram.\n",
      "textFontSizeHint": 16
